#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:206
msgid ""
"PowerDevil was compiled without Xss and Xext support, or the XSync extension "
"is not available. Determining idle time will not be possible. Please "
"consider recompiling PowerDevil with at least one of these two libraries."
msgstr ""
"PowerDevil foi compilado sen soporte de Xss nen de Xext, ou non está "
"disponíbel a extensión XSync. Non será posíbel determinar o tempo de "
"ociosidade. Considere a posibilidade de recompilar PowerDevil con polo menos "
"unha desta dúas bibliotecas."

#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:212
msgid ""
"No scaling methods were found. If your CPU is reasonably recent, this is "
"probably because you have not loaded some kernel modules. Usually scaling "
"modules have names similar to cpufreq_ondemand. Scaling is useful and can "
"save a lot of battery. Click on \"Attempt Loading Modules\" to let "
"PowerDevil try to load the required modules. If you are sure your PC does "
"not support scaling, you can also disable this warning by clicking \"Do not "
"display this warning again\"."
msgstr ""

#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:219
msgid "Attempt loading Modules"
msgstr ""

#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:220
msgid "Do not display this warning again"
msgstr ""

#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:223
msgid ""
"PowerDevil was compiled without Xext support, or the XSync extension is not "
"available. XSync grants extra efficiency and performance, saving your "
"battery and CPU. It is advised to use PowerDevil with XSync enabled."
msgstr ""
"PowerDevil foi compilado sen soporte de Xext, ou non está disponíbel a "
"extensión XSync. XSync garante mellor eficiencia e desempeño, e aforra "
"batería e CPU. Recoméndase empregar PowerDevil con XSync habilitado."

#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:242 kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:250
msgid "No issues found with your configuration."
msgstr "Non se achou nengún problema coa configuración."

#: kcmodule/CapabilitiesPage.cpp:244
msgid ""
"XSync does not seem your preferred query backend, though it is available on "
"your system. Using it largely improves performance and efficiency, and it is "
"strongly advised. Click on the button below to enable it now."
msgstr ""
"Semella que XSync non é a súa infraestrutura preferida, aínda que está "
"disponíbel no sistema. Empregala mellora moito o rendimento e a eficiencia, "
"polo que é recomendada. Prema no botón de baixo para habilitala."

